{
  "note": [
    "NBIF staff, and the platform's authorisation roster (ADR-005). Loaded by db:seed.",
    "",
    "IDENTITY comes from this file: entra_object_id, display_name and email are",
    "re-asserted on every seed, so a corrected spelling or a changed address",
    "propagates. AUTHORISATION does not: `role` and `is_active` are applied when",
    "the row is CREATED and never overwritten afterwards. That is the ADR-005",
    "position -- Entra proves identity, the platform decides permission, and",
    "changing someone's role is a database update rather than a code change and a",
    "deploy. A seed that re-asserted role would silently revert it.",
    "",
    "display_name must match the Affinity Person's name exactly: the A4 sync",
    "resolves deal leads and owners on it, because Affinity merges Person entities",
    "and their email addresses are not reliably the @nbif.ca ones.",
    "",
    "Board members are NOT here. They receive PDFs, not accounts (ADR-005)."
  ],
